</th>
<th>III
</th>
<th>IV
</th></tr>
<tr>
<td>Approximate blood loss
</td>
<td>&lt;15%
</td>
<td>15-30%
</td>
<td>30-40%
</td>
<td>&gt;40%
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Heart rate
</td>
<td>↔
</td>
