<ul><li>Shah, Essential Emergency Trauma, pgs 143-148</li>
<li>Bailitz J, Bokhari F, Scaletta TA, Schaider J. Emergent Management of Trauma. New York: The McGraw-Hill Company, 2011: pg 193.</li></ul>
